  "description": "Design and manufacture of precision timekeeping devices: gear cutting, escapement manufacturing, spring tempering, and precision bearing making. Spans from weight-driven tower clocks through spring-driven pocket watches to marine chronometers. Clockmaking was the cradle of precision manufacturing — gear trains, escapements, and jeweled bearings developed here directly enabled machine tool evolution.",
